WEBVTT

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:06.960
Dad!

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:07.700
Leo!

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:08.600
Professor!

00:00:09.910 --> 00:00:11.070
Dad!

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:32.720
I guess...

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.860
I guess this means I died.

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:50.200
Kizuna, is that you?

00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:59.350
I lost my way on Jupiter.

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:02.190
But by using a mysterious power...

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:05.590
...I was able to preserve just my spirit as a life-form.

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:08.090
You mean you used Za Powa?

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:13.060
I tried so many times to make contact with Earth...

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:18.800
...but projecting three different emotions onto Gai's image processor...

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:20.360
...was the most I could manage.

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:25.280
But here on Jupiter, you're able to assume your original form?

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:26.810
Yes.

00:01:29.790 --> 00:01:30.880
Leo...

00:01:33.190 --> 00:01:35.820
I missed you so, Kizuna...

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:43.280
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:46.180
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:52.960
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:57.800
Run, you powerful Robot Brigade!

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:04.030
With your red gaze and your silver chest!

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:08.120
The G-Stone is your bond with the lion

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:12.820
to save the future of outer space.

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:16.780
It's time to launch!

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:19.960
Destroying the souls of the people...

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:23.880
Smash the Zonder Metal to pieces!

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:28.580
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:31.540
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:34.460
}Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:37.210
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:40.720
Pulverizing steel!

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:44.390
Goldion Hammer!

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:51.920
Magic! Drive! Ultimate power! Guts!

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:57.920
A hero is born! Great God of Iron...

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:00.740
Our very own King of Braves!

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:04.920
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:08.950
You are hereby ordered to fuse with the Ultimate King of Braves legend!

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:17.790
Leo...

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:25.430
Entohji! What happened to the Murakumo?

00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:28.230
It plunged into Jupiter's atmosphere...

00:03:29.570 --> 00:03:32.040
...and exploded.

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:37.200
Professor!

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:40.040
What about GaoGaiGar?

00:03:40.550 --> 00:03:42.910
He's still in pursuit of the Murakumo...

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:45.020
...and he's falling towards Jupiter.

00:03:53.860 --> 00:03:58.060
Dammit!

00:03:58.520 --> 00:04:03.260
Those Who Have Courage

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:02.420
<i>Those Who Have Courage</i>

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:15.480
J-Quath!

00:04:33.070 --> 00:04:34.660
15 more to go!

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:42.040
J-Quath!

00:04:58.930 --> 00:05:00.090
What's happening?

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:01.760
Take that!

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:06.220
We're way outnumbered!

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:08.960
It's no big deal!

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:10.770
FF Mirror, release!

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:15.500
Reflector Beam, launch!

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:28.490
What's going on?

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:32.990
Enemy satellite approaching!

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:35.490
No! It's on track for a direct hit!

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:36.590
Evade at top speed!

00:05:43.270 --> 00:05:45.300
This isn't good! Amaterasu, convert!

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:47.100
We're going to rescue Susanoh!

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:50.270
Redire!

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:15.960
All hands, abandon ship!

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:19.260
GGG will now make its base on Amaterasu!

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:38.050
Mikoto! Be strong!

00:06:38.590 --> 00:06:39.460
Right.

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:43.730
Hurry, board Amaterasu!

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:44.860
Get a move on!

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:47.600
You guys! Don't any of you croak on me!

00:06:50.110 --> 00:06:52.300
Volfogg! You've got to escape too!

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:53.840
I shall remain here.

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:57.380
I shall continue my Reflector Beam assault until the last second!

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:02.410
Mirror Particle Cannons! Cover fire, blast away!

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:17.730
I'll see you all vanish into eternal darkness!

00:07:18.230 --> 00:07:20.700
Ultimate Gravity Wave!

00:07:25.270 --> 00:07:26.040
What's this?

00:07:28.910 --> 00:07:31.610
No!

00:07:33.780 --> 00:07:34.750
Gai...

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:48.550
Am I...

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:50.390
...just going...

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:52.460
...to die like this?

00:07:53.270 --> 00:07:55.400
Gai Shishioh.

00:07:57.340 --> 00:07:58.310
Gai...

00:07:58.440 --> 00:08:01.030
Can you hear my voice?

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:01.900
Who are you?

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:04.840
My name is Cain.

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:10.180
So you're Mamoru's...

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:15.390
At this moment as I speak to you...

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:20.890
I am no more than a copy of myself, buried inside Galeon.

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:23.960
Because I lost my physical body...

00:08:24.030 --> 00:08:26.900
...and became part of Galeon...

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:31.570
...I was unable to raise my son myself.

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:35.940
So that's why you sent Mamoru to the Amami's.

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:43.210
My personality imprint sustained damage in that first battle with EI-01.

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:45.420
And I lost all functionality.

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:50.120
Thanks to the force of Za Powa, I am finally able to speak.

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:51.760
Za Powa?

00:08:51.930 --> 00:08:56.890
Here in outer space, there are many sources of mysterious energy.

00:08:57.700 --> 00:09:00.690
You could say that Za Powa is one of them.

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:04.700
Those who have been imbued with Za Powa...

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:07.970
...are able to expand their native abilities.

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:11.880
Gai...

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:15.210
I am most grateful to you.

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:21.980
If all had gone as planned, I should've been the one to fuse with Galeon.

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:25.630
No, I'm the one who should be thanking you.

00:09:29.300 --> 00:09:31.790
Because it was you who gave me all my powers...

00:09:32.100 --> 00:09:34.260
...the power to protect the ones that I love.

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:38.600
Thank you, Gai.

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:46.110
It seems that my life is at its end now.

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:50.370
Latio...

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:55.320
You've grown to be a fine boy, both spiritually and physically.

00:09:56.190 --> 00:09:59.960
Allow me to break the final seal on you now.

00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:14.300
It is time for you to use this power to do what is right.

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:25.910
Gai...

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:29.490
I'm leaving everything to you now.

00:10:29.990 --> 00:10:32.430
I believe in your courage!

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.690
I believe in you...

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:14.300
Latio, I will always be near you...

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:17.530
I understand now...

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:20.570
How I'm really supposed to use the G-Stone...

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:22.300
And also...

00:11:22.610 --> 00:11:25.410
The one who always watched over me on the Green Planet...

00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:28.110
Those kind eyes...

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:32.140
The same kind eyes as Galeon...

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:35.560
Gai...

00:11:36.860 --> 00:11:39.350
Borrow the energy of Za Powa.

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:41.330
Go on now, Gai.

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:43.290
Dad... Mom...

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:47.300
Remember the energy that resurrected ChoRyuJin.

00:11:47.570 --> 00:11:51.770
But be careful, you mustn't lose yourself in Za Powa!

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:01.880
Dad...

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:03.120
Mom...

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:04.490
Cain...

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:06.910
Your sons are going into battle.

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:09.650
Please watch over us till the end.

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:25.640
I'll see you all vanish into eternal darkness!

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:34.150
Gai...

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:38.250
Protect Wall

00:12:46.790 --> 00:12:47.520
Gai!

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:48.390
Mamoru!

00:12:48.460 --> 00:12:49.550
GaoGaiGar!

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:51.370
You managed to resurrect yourself?

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:53.730
You now have Za Powa!

00:12:54.070 --> 00:12:55.760
We never lost faith in you, brave hero!

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:01.900
Hey, guys! Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:05.410
All right!

00:13:05.810 --> 00:13:07.470
I'm addressing all members of GGG.

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:09.280
You're to gather all your concentration on one objective!

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:10.950
We are now going to launch...

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:13.180
...a counterattack!

00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:14.220
Right!

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:16.280
Fire!

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:23.120
Phantom Ring!

00:13:25.930 --> 00:13:26.870
Plus!

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:32.600
Broken Phantom!

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:09.130
A-Amazing!

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:14.510
This brings to mind what we saw 65 million years ago!

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:16.970
Is this that same miraculous energy?

00:14:20.020 --> 00:14:23.320
I can feel a tremendous power flooding my entire body too!

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:28.020
Is this Za Powa?

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:42.280
Symmetrical Out!

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:56.880
Hammer Connect!

00:14:57.890 --> 00:15:01.060
GouRyuJin!

00:15:01.860 --> 00:15:04.960
GenRyuJin!

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:10.270
Goldion Hammer!

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:15.640
Hey, Primeval!

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:18.810
Transform into Light!

00:15:42.640 --> 00:15:43.600
Gai...

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:48.830
Curatio!

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:50.880
Redire!

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:55.810
Zonder Crystals, 9 more to go!

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:58.410
Reflector Beam, launch!

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:23.340
Coctura!

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.010
Redire!

00:16:27.450 --> 00:16:29.210
6 more to go!

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:36.620
All set to go!

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:58.640
Maximum Tou Long!

00:17:12.490 --> 00:17:14.520
3 more to go!

00:17:24.970 --> 00:17:27.810
Transform into Light!

00:17:27.910 --> 00:17:29.740
Coctura!

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:41.350
I never dreamed the energy on this planet...

00:17:41.420 --> 00:17:43.620
...could be this powerful!

00:17:46.660 --> 00:17:48.650
2 more Crystals to go!

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:51.360
And now I'm going to fulfill my duty as a warrior!

00:17:51.470 --> 00:17:52.760
J!

00:17:52.970 --> 00:17:55.760
10-linked Maser Cannons! J-Quath!

00:18:20.730 --> 00:18:21.720
You're not getting away!

00:18:26.570 --> 00:18:31.560
Energy of Jupiter, Za Powa. All analysis complete.

00:18:34.510 --> 00:18:37.070
Now fusing with the Z-Master!

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:49.490
It's the Heart Primeval!

00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:59.560
I should've exterminated you on the Red Planet!

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:21.520
Now I've collected all of the Primevals.

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:26.750
Restoration and recombination... start.

00:19:38.470 --> 00:19:42.030
Ultra-high-density energy detected on Jupiter's surface!

00:19:42.510 --> 00:19:44.670
Ultra-high-density energy?

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:52.840
King J-Der!

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:02.890
What happened? What in the world...

00:20:02.960 --> 00:20:08.490
Watch your back. That's the aggregate of all 31 Primevals...

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:10.000
...the Z-Master!

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:11.900
The Z-Master?

00:20:12.670 --> 00:20:16.040
The 31 Primevals are part of a single entity.

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:20.280
Each of them serving to subject all of outer space to mechanization...

00:20:20.350 --> 00:20:23.080
They're each a part of the Z-Master!

00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:26.050
Wh-Who knew...

00:20:26.190 --> 00:20:29.640
...that the Primevals would regenerate from the Crystals!

00:20:29.820 --> 00:20:31.090
Now that they're one...

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:34.860
...they have the ability to mechanize 100 times as fast!

00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:39.430
And if, on top of that, they're also using Jupiter's force, Za Powa...

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:53.140
Z-Master?

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:08.650
Don't tell me that's...

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:10.860
I'm detecting massive amounts of Elementary Particle Z0!

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:12.090
Those are Zonder spores!

00:21:12.630 --> 00:21:17.900
Unbelievable, those Zonders just matured instantaneously!

00:21:18.370 --> 00:21:24.540
Behold, the force of Za Powa has just enabled us to recombine...

00:21:24.610 --> 00:21:26.310
...into the Master Program!

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:27.610
What's that?

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:31.780
My alter egos, go forth to the Blue Planet!

00:21:32.090 --> 00:21:35.820
No! It's going to spray the planet with those Zonder spores!

00:21:37.720 --> 00:21:39.450
Let's smash that thing to pieces!

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:48.530
No!

00:21:48.600 --> 00:21:49.660
An ES Window?

00:21:50.300 --> 00:21:53.170
Did he just transport those spores in a split second?

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:54.800
But that's not possible!

00:22:01.550 --> 00:22:04.310
What's going to happen to Earth?

00:22:05.850 --> 00:22:08.120
Everybody! Don't give up hope!

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:11.620
Kaidou and I know what's going on here!

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:16.660
All 31 of the Primeval Cores are stored inside that Z-Master.

00:22:17.360 --> 00:22:20.560
We're going to Purify those Primevals into Crystals again!

00:22:21.470 --> 00:22:24.770
If we can destroy the Crystal's mechanization program in one blow...

00:22:24.840 --> 00:22:27.000
...it will stop the mechanization process!

00:22:27.570 --> 00:22:28.910
I see...

00:22:30.010 --> 00:22:34.070
In other words, we just have to destroy him!

00:22:38.290 --> 00:22:41.850
This is a fitting place for a warrior to die.

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:50.370
Even if there are more than a million stars between us...

00:22:51.570 --> 00:22:55.240
...I know I can get there without losing my way.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:01.420
Because I can see the road that leads to you.

00:23:01.420 --> 00:23:06.210
It's sparkling ahead of me.

00:23:06.840 --> 00:23:10.380
The journey I began that day...

00:23:11.550 --> 00:23:17.310
...will surely make our bond even stronger.

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:24.070
The wings that send me into the galaxy...

00:23:24.070 --> 00:23:28.730
...let's believe in them now.

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:34.070
When you and I are grown up

00:23:34.070 --> 00:23:41.070
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.450 --> 00:23:48.480
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:49.790 --> 00:23:51.990
Earth is facing annihilation.

00:23:52.160 --> 00:23:54.590
The ultimate confrontation with Za Powa!

00:23:54.960 --> 00:23:57.050
A last-ditch effort by all who survived...

00:23:57.400 --> 00:24:01.160
It is time for you to become a brave hero and join the battle!

00:24:02.540 --> 00:24:04.530
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:04.600 --> 00:24:06.600
"Ending the Mechanization Threat"

00:24:06.610 --> 00:24:06.650
Ending the Mechanization Threat

00:24:06.670 --> 00:24:09.730
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.350 --> 00:24:15.350
Mikoto  Utsugi

00:24:13.180 --> 00:24:14.820
This is the Key to Victory!
